==============================================================================
1. VACUOUSNESS CHECK - reported FIRST, before any coherence number
==============================================================================
Entry 192 predicts mode MAGNITUDES depend on depth alone, r entering
as the common scale 2^(r/2) plus phase. If that holds for the
quantity the statistic is built on, every concentration measure
returns the same number at a zero and at its neighbour BY
CONSTRUCTION and nothing is measured. Two quantities, separated:

  |z_k|          complex modulus. psi form: factors exactly as
                 2^(r/2)|1-2^(-rho)|^(d+1)/|rho|, so PREDICTED
                 r-independent at fixed depth. pi form: OPEN.
  |c_k|=2|Re z|  the REAL contribution actually summed. Carries
                 cos(arg z_k), and arg z_k depends on r, so this is
                 an OPEN MEASUREMENT in BOTH forms.

